# resume-tweaker (Cursor)

Follow `specs/002-resume-tweaker/spec.md` + `docs/resume-tweaker-architecture.md`.

- DB: `jobs` + `job_analysis` (existing, read-only schema) → new `job_groups`, `tweak_suggestions`, `resume_versions`.
- Groq free tier only (live catalog 2026-09-19):
  - rewrite/suggest = `openai/gpt-oss-120b` (fallback `qwen/qwen3.8-27b`)
  - grouping = `openai/gpt-oss-20b` (fallback `qwen/qwen3.8-27b`)
  - `temperature=0`, JSON mode, backoff on 429. No preview models.
- Secrets: `GROQ_API_KEY` from env/`.env` only. Never emit or commit keys.
- Human-in-the-loop is load-bearing: `accept` uses suggestion, `edit`/`custom` merges `user_text`, `skip` writes nothing. `rewrite` must read the stored decision.
- No hallucinated employers/dates/metrics. Missing evidence → `"evidence": null`.
- Tests must mock Groq (no network): `pytest tests/test_resume_tweaker.py`.
